WEBVTT

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:01.830
you do get to pick
which ones you internalize

00:10:01.863 --> 00:10:03.563
and which ones you express.

00:10:04.097 --> 00:10:06.697
I started to see emotions
as works in progress,

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:07.863
kind of like art.

00:10:08.263 --> 00:10:09.530
If you were a painter,

00:10:09.563 --> 00:10:12.030
you probably wouldn't frame
your first sketch.

00:10:12.063 --> 00:10:14.630
Your initial feelings
are just a rough draft.

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:18.930
As you gain perspective,
you can rethink and revise what you feel.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:21.730
So that's what I did.

00:10:21.763 --> 00:10:24.830
Instead of defensiveness,
I tried curiosity.

00:10:24.863 --> 00:10:27.797
I wondered, "What would happen
if I became the student?"

00:10:28.397 --> 00:10:30.597
I threw out my plan for one day of class,